   "bio": "For decades, the beautifully fired ceramics of the Koopman family have been a staple in Nordhaven. But when Gert took over the family shop in his youth he wasn't confident he could run it all on his own, that is until he met Jolanda. It was love at first glaze, and together the Terra-Potta grew more successful than ever. Yet things can change with time. After many years of marriage, including a daughter who has moved out to university, Jolanda and Gert are not seeing eye to eye as much as they used to. Much of their time is spent apart; while she looks after the main shop, he often handles the stalls at the local markets—where he's been noticed as particularly friendly with some of the clientele, at least according to the gossips. Can this couple reignite their passion, or is this love broken beyond repair?",
   "bioFrom": "EA"
