   "bio": "Since Gammelvik's founding there's always been a Koffieboon cafe, and it's always had the Lodens behind it. When it was her turn to run the business, Nora stepped in happily, but who will step in after her? Nora's daughter, Freya, never had much interest in inheriting the cafe, much preferring her deep love for dancing. Meanwhile the younger son, Erik, shows a lot more aptitude for crafting with clays and paints than he does business. Now Nora's feeling pressured to not disappoint the legacy of her late father and the many Lodens before him, even despite reassurances from her mama, Hattie. Thankfully, she has her wife Dahlia there to support her—and provide an escape or two through her critically acclaimed, titillating romance novels.",
   "bioFrom": "EA"
