   "bio": "After years of apprenticeship with a pair of underground tattoo artists, Nia moved back to Nordhaven to pursue the dream of opening her own tattoo studio in the city where she grew up. But on top of the new set of skills and business ambition, she also came back with a child. Her daughter, Lerato, was just as thrilled to move to a new place...hoping to get the highest room and be even closer to the constellations she loves studying. This is the beginning of a new chapter in Nia's life, as she begins to wonder what will be more challenging: being a single parent or starting her own business?",
   "bioFrom": "EA"
