   "bio": "When Cannonball moved to Nordhaven he first made his coin performing at The Rouge Note. Locals loved his music, and it wasn't long before he set his sights on buying the venue and fulfilling the old dream of running his own jazz lounge—alas, he was still a few coins short. A new opportunity came around when Cannonball met Crispin, who in his own youth had spent a little too much on post-modern art sculptures, but was now looking to save some Simoleons for his adoptive kid Ollie. Before long they all moved in together and have been splitting the bills since. Now yes, Crispin can sometimes be too pompous, and sure, Cannonball can't afford the lounge quite just yet, but our dreamer has really found his groove in this new city. And as a man who's never had a chance to be a father, he's grown quite fond of having Ollie in his life.",
   "bioFrom": "EA"
